The calendar agrees with `BOOK_MAP.md` §6 (`BOOK_MAP.md:203-216`) and with the day-131 Book 7 seam (`book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-60.md:219-229`):

| Days | Surviving prose | Ruling |
|---|---|---|
| 131, 133 | `chapter-01.md:7,197,269-283` | Entry later on the 131st; rate on 133. Correct. |
| 138–146 | `chapter-02.md:3,51,233-243,265-281` | Two-day road, calf on 140, posts 141–145, Pike on 146. Correct. |
| 147–150 | `chapter-03.md:3,87,157,235,293-305` | First yard on 148; shed trials on 150. Correct. |
| 158, 161 | `chapter-04.md:3,69-77,239-243` | Second yard, then ice road after a week of road-ice. Correct. |
