   113	14. **Karis's case — KEEP AFTER PROTECTED RESTORATION.** The instructions inference, kept key, Treswick, Deepstacks, provision, and retained paper are within the packet; the full source unit must replace the marker and paraphrase (`manuscript/chapter-06.md:227-253`; fixes 11–14).
   114	15. **Thornwater — KEEP.** Ford, ledge, ankle, arm release, shoulder deference, bowman, and six-count all agree with the inherited bodies and consent rules (`manuscript/chapter-06.md:3-51,79-151`).
   115	16. **Unnamed roles — KEEP.** No new named person, place, or animal is minted; all listed newcomers remain roles (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:3-45,197-251`; `manuscript/chapter-02.md:15-47`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:81-85`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:61-77`).
