editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md-39-**Physical challenge:** the shale-back fence and the ice road (set pieces), the silent-yard bouts (learning fights) and the Thornwater ford.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md-40-**Cutaways (~4,500):** Karis, ~2,500, on a cold night [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 19] with the index: her want, and her refusal to theorize about the cord. Teague, ~2,000, at the upper inn: the young one asks to learn; the wrist; he cannot read the sheet and does not need to.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md-41-**Development:** about 14 Cael beats. Supporting: Lira 2–3, Karis 2–3, Brom 2, Seln 1–2, Oryn 2, Teague 1, Pike 1, the young one 1.
