editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-420-| **The Fractured Path predates the classification system** (the Architect designed it; ~400 years; the purpose was the un-bound) | **8 — DELIVER** | Deliver once, in the leaf (M6), in the record's voice. Karis paraphrases it once. Name scraped; "the Architect" is a title. The narrative reports the record's rationale and **does not endorse it**. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-421-| The Arbiter system is the Architect's live infrastructure | 9 | Plants only: "Behaves as device. Cannot be."; "no key"; the lamps finding on its own page; the dark Arbiter unchanged. Never join the leaf to the sigils. No *terminal / circuit / infrastructure*. The Arbiter never speaks. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-422-| Cael is a recurrence (the tomb; the un-bound practitioner's record) | 9 | Never say "recurrence". No tomb, no hint of one. "The same kind of made" and "the pattern" are the ceiling. The third sentence stays unwritten. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-423-| The court's name | 9 | "The court", lowercase, descriptive only. Never "the Court", never "Still Court". |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:424:| Vastin's request and the 3–2 vote | 9 | Not staged, hinted or scheduled. He does not ask; nobody asks; nobody discusses whether he should. "Unadmitted." |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-425-| The Compact's open internal fracture | 9 | One closed pre-echo: the directive and objection. Seals unnamed. Not pried. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-426-| The Architect's will is active and hunting Cael | 11 | Three deniable plant families only: (1) the running sub-layer sequence (S3/S5); (2) "is in it —", marked (S15); (3) the instruments and the station clustering on Cael, trending up (S1/S5/S14/S22, plus the Span row). Attributed in-world to his unreadability. "Made things do not know." Nothing says or implies agency. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-427-| The Quieting's source, spread and reset | 10–11 | Every site is old and stable. **No first-tier site is produced** (the box stays unfilled). No maker's present will, no purpose beyond the leaf's, no spread, no reset. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-428-| The Fractured Path is primordial | 13 | Never *primordial / before / source* about Cael. Interior read as *structure*, felt not explained. |
