+**RESOLVED within the brief's bounded scope.** The opening and Karis cutaway received selective joins rather than mechanical expansion. The one added lived beat is `chapter-05.md:217-225`: Cael spends “a copper of his own” to restore the edge on Lira's knife; she asks for nothing, tests it, and cuts the loaf one-handed. This does not violate BOOK_MAP §13.
